{"blocks":[["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5230","Oscillator type: SuperWave (factory Vocoder).",["Notes","Customized controls"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5322","Octave: +3 (factory 0).",["Notes","Customized controls"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5401","Decay/Release: 0.000 (factory 0.259).",["Notes","Customized controls"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5511","Paraphonic: off (factory on).",["Notes","Customized controls"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5604","Seq: on (factory off).",["Notes","Customized controls"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5702","Performance and session context",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-5740","In GitP/A/Session/26/11/14-Sat a recording of the chirp, made from the MicroFreak on November 12, 2026, sat on pad D♯2 of the Piano Pool drum rack. Launchpad sequencer track 2 struck it on most half-minute boundaries of the performance. The MicroFreak itself played Microfreak/Preset/259 Infini Pad during the performance, so the saved settings here describe the recorded chirp rather than anything played live.",["Notes","Performance and session context"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-6166","Evidence and interpretation",["Notes"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-6200","Values describe saved base settings before modulation. Controls use normalized 0…1 values unless a stored choice code is shown; they are not OLED percentages, hertz or milliseconds.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-6388","The saved-parameter inspector preserves the original fields. Oscillator interpretation assumes the documented firmware 5 layout; firmware is not detected from the export.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/Preset/399%20FireAlarmLoBat/","source-block-6661","Matrix assignments follow the Freakout live map. Mode, LFO shape, filter type and octave labels follow the MicroFreak Reader definitions.",["Notes","Evidence and interpretation"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-108","MicroFreak User Guide",[]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-134","The MicroFreak user guide documents the instrument and its controls.",["MicroFreak User Guide"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-206","Sections",["MicroFreak User Guide"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-221","Microfreak/UG/01 Welcome and Introduction",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-271","Microfreak/UG/02 Installation",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-309","Microfreak/UG/03 Overview",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-343","Microfreak/UG/04 Presets",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-376","Microfreak/UG/05 Connections",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-413","Microfreak/UG/06 Dig Osc",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-446","Microfreak/UG/07 Filter",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-478","Microfreak/UG/08 LFO",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-507","Microfreak/UG/09 Envelope Gen",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-545","Microfreak/UG/10 Keyboard",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-579","Microfreak/UG/11 Icon Strip",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]],["Microfreak/UG/","source-block-615","Microfreak/UG/12 Arpeggiator",["MicroFreak User Guide","Sections"]]],"format_version":5}